            <ArticleTitle>Third-rank chromatic aberrations of electron lenses.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>27-31</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="pii" ValidYN="Y">S0304-3991(17)30320-0</ELocationID>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1016/j.ultramic.2017.11.006</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>In this paper the third-rank chromatic aberration coefficients of round electron lenses are analytically derived and numerically calculated by Mathematica. Furthermore, the numerical results are cross-checked by the differential algebraic (DA) method, which verifies that all the formulas for the third-rank chromatic aberration coefficients are completely correct. It is hoped that this work would be helpful for further chromatic aberration correction in electron microscopy.</AbstractText>
